{"ID":"20240118151105-htq7o2r","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151105-htq7o2r","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151105-htq7o2r\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151105-xfht1ah\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122135906-bmu321p\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122135836-yc9bder\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:30,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:30\u0026#125;","title":"225羖[gǔ]羊角226牡狗阴茎","type":"doc","updated":"20240201174650"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151105-xfht1ah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151105-xfht1ah","updated":"20240122135821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"羖羊角"}]},{"ID":"20240122135818-82c7oq8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135818-82c7oq8","updated":"20240122135832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，温，无毒，治青盲，明目，杀疥虫，止寒泄，辟恶鬼，虎，狼，止惊悸。久服安心，益气，轻身。生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135832-gx3je72","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135832-gx3je72"}},{"ID":"20240122135836-yc9bder","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135836-yc9bder","updated":"20240201174650"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第225，这个字念“古”，羖羊角。那这个羖羊角呢，羖就是黑色的意思，黑的羊，黑羊的角，诸位可以看看就好了！"}]},{"ID":"20240122135837-kn7r7hl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135837-kn7r7hl"}},{"ID":"20240122135843-wippsrn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135843-wippsrn","updated":"20240122135844"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"牡狗阴茎"}]},{"ID":"20240122135858-ww3km88","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135858-ww3km88","updated":"20240122135901"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味咸，平，无毒。治伤中，阴痿不起，令强热大，生子，除女子带下十二疾。胆，平。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135901-djosij3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135901-djosij3","updated":"20240122135905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"主明目。一名狗精。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122135906-thc6p0h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135906-thc6p0h"}},{"ID":"20240122135906-bmu321p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122135906-bmu321p","updated":"20240122135911"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"226，牡狗阴茎，你要吃你再去说，这里我们没有用过，我也不会用这个。"}]}]}